        <li>[2] <a href="https://support.apple.com/en-us/111883">Apple — MacBook Air (M2) power adapter and charging specifications</a></li>
        <li>[3] <a href="/guides/usb-c-cable-buying-guide">StackGeist — USB-C cable buying guide</a></li>
      </ol></section>
    </div>
  </article>
